<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY  **11.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    11.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE THEN STEPS UP TO 5.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALL AT PAR YEAR ONE ONLY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
